{
    "title": "Little Panda's Town: Hospital",
    "description": "A large hospital in town is now open! Welcome to come here and explore! Explore Little Panda's Town: Hospital, and create your own hospital story!\r\n\r\nEXPLORE THE LARGE HOSPITAL\r\nLittle Panda\u2019s Town: Hospital will simulate a real large hospital! There are a total of 5 floors here! Neonatal department, dental department, emergency room, patient wards, pharmacy, and more! You can freely explore all scenes and collect your creative inspiration!\r\n\r\nTRY DIFFERENT ITEMS\r\nStethoscopes, syringes, X-ray machines, and more, a variety of medical equipment is available for your use! All items can be used across different scenes! This means you can freely try various combinations of them and see what different results they bring!\r\n\r\nEXPERIENCE HOSPITAL WORK\r\nReal hospital work awaits you! Become a surgeon and perform complex surgeries! Be a dentist and eliminate tooth cavities! Or be a pharmacist and prepare the right medicines! Shuttle between different departments and help more patients!\r\n\r\nCREATE NOVEL STORIES\r\nIn this hospital, what kind of story do you want to write? Deliver babies for pregnant women? Rescue seriously injured patients? Doctors, nurses, newborns, and more! 40+ characters are at your disposal and ready to work with you to create novel hospital stories!\r\n\r\nAttention, please! New patients have arrived at the hospital! Get busy!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Simulate a real large hospital;\r\n- Explore scenes such as ambulances, dental clinic, patient wards, and more;\r\n- Operate medical equipment like stethoscopes, X-ray machines, and more;\r\n- Treat burns, fractures, tooth decay, and more;\r\n- Experience the work of doctors, nurses, pharmacists, and more;\r\n- 40+ distinct and unique characters;\r\n- All items can be used across scenes!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "A large hospital in town is now open! Welcome to come here and explore! Explore Little Panda&#39;s Town: Hospital, and create your own hospital story!<br><br>EXPLORE THE LARGE HOSPITAL<br>Little Panda\u2019s Town: Hospital will simulate a real large hospital! There are a total of 5 floors here! Neonatal department, dental department, emergency room, patient wards, pharmacy, and more! You can freely explore all scenes and collect your creative inspiration!<br><br>TRY DIFFERENT ITEMS<br>Stethoscopes, syringes, X-ray machines, and more, a variety of medical equipment is available for your use! All items can be used across different scenes! This means you can freely try various combinations of them and see what different results they bring!<br><br>EXPERIENCE HOSPITAL WORK<br>Real hospital work awaits you! Become a surgeon and perform complex surgeries! Be a dentist and eliminate tooth cavities! Or be a pharmacist and prepare the right medicines! Shuttle between different departments and help more patients!<br><br>CREATE NOVEL STORIES<br>In this hospital, what kind of story do you want to write? Deliver babies for pregnant women? Rescue seriously injured patients? Doctors, nurses, newborns, and more! 40+ characters are at your disposal and ready to work with you to create novel hospital stories!<br><br>Attention, please! New patients have arrived at the hospital! Get busy!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- Simulate a real large hospital;<br>- Explore scenes such as ambulances, dental clinic, patient wards, and more;<br>- Operate medical equipment like stethoscopes, X-ray machines, and more;<br>- Treat burns, fractures, tooth decay, and more;<br>- Experience the work of doctors, nurses, pharmacists, and more;<br>- 40+ distinct and unique characters;<br>- All items can be used across scenes!<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children&#39;s apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>Contact us: ser@babybus.com<br>Visit us: http://www.babybus.com",
